[en.FOCUS_C12_IMPROVE_ROCKFORGED]
Improve Rockforged Warriors

[en.FOCUS_C12_IMPROVE_ROCKFORGED_desc]
Although nations across the land have become widely aware of the existence of the Rockforged Warriors and have taken many countermeasures, the current technological level of the rock farm is now capable of supporting a second upgrade and body modification for the Rockforged Warriors. However, I actually have an idea of my own for this project...

[zh.FOCUS_C12_IMPROVE_ROCKFORGED]
继续改进铸岩神兵

[zh.FOCUS_C12_IMPROVE_ROCKFORGED_desc]
虽然各国已经广泛了解了铸岩者的存在并做出了许多针对性措施，但是现在采石农场的科技水平足以支撑的起铸岩者的更强大的升级和身体改装。然而，其实我对这个项目有了一个自己的想法...


[en.PIHC_C12_IMPROVE_ROCKFORGED_WARRIORS_TOOLTIP]
The Rock Farm will consider further improvements to the Rockforged Warriors.

[zh.PIHC_C12_IMPROVE_ROCKFORGED_WARRIORS_TOOLTIP]
采石农场将商讨进一步改进铸岩神兵的计划。
